---
layout: base.njk
---
<h1>{{ site.title }}</h1>
<p class="lede">{{ site.description }}</p>

<p>No trackers, no ads. Black type, white background. Plain HTML and a touch of CSS. Still accessible.</p>
<p>Privacy policy: I don't collect or retain any data at all. Ever.</p>

<h2>Blog</h2>
<ul class="posts">
{%- for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
  <li><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time> <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
